=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Rasdinice.
* Travel to the Beastmen Stand at (J-7) in Vunkerl Inlet.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into Everbloom Hollow.
* Two groups of three Orcs (six total) will immediately start slowly running towards their designated ends.
** {m:Orcish Carrier} - Will Occasionally run away while fighting. Susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}
** Orcish Grunt x2 - Links with the {m:Orcish Carrier}, does not run. Susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}
** Should the {m:Orcish Carrier} make it to the end of the area (which is smaller than the area in {p:Pit Spider I (S)}) the mission is failed.
* Once all six Orcs are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
* **Exit at the Twilight Aureole to complete the mission.**
* Return and talk to Rasdinice for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to Everbloom Hollow.
* All 3 of the Orc are Susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}.
* Repetative stun/sleep/bind is helpful in this battle.
* The Orcs are very weak.
** Approximately 2500 HP each.
* The Orca will warp out of you fail to kill them quickly enough.
* Be sure to exit at the Twilight Aureole to complete the mission.
* The following actions will cause you to fail this mission:
** Leaving before killing the Orcs.
** Warping out directly after killing the Orcs.

